  "body": "## Changelog\n* a05c794575d1c88084c240ee0224a0b14f5287ef Wait for remote builders that are already starting (#5503)\n* bcfadc11c80a991994cd978e90bd2cfaf6c48cd2 Report token refresh failures before SSH console calls Machines (#5501)\n* 1b4745162abbb63b543662e21f489082c39e99b4 Build Laravel assets on Node 22 (#5417)\n* 8f2258c967be77db204aec41d52f68a166c4aaa6 Finish lease acquisition spans and record failures (#5502)\n* bd388317ac5a24bda597efa4893fef5dc0c597c0 Record structured workflow failure codes for SSH selection (#5500)\n* 0549074b42b4f5140f21a5044aa4950654ec392c Wait for an in-progress Machine start (#5499)\n* 68e9f3418942d8f01b5c5c00e46b2315cabace76 Limit each release-command exit-event read to 30 seconds (#5498)\n\n"
